// Welcome to the Net: the guide Sense/Net ships with the deck (crates/core/src/cards.rs).
// One idea per card. Text lines are at most 54 columns and 11 rows once {placeholders} fill in;
// placeholders read the rules and data (cards::PLACEHOLDERS), so the facts can't drift.
// Pictures are 1-bit pixel art: `#` ink, `.` paper.
